{"id":"vod_sn_35611","vodId":"35611","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"黄金拼图第一季","name_cn":"黄金拼图第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/766fcf8c8f147c5a218ed48cc5b674cf.jpg"},"summary":"大宫忍（西明日香 配音）是一位平凡的十五岁少女，黑瞳黑发，从头到尾，从里到外都是标准日本少女样貌的她，其实有过寄宿在英国家庭的经历。忍的个性成熟而又稳重，温文尔雅，但却又十分执着，有着自己的主意和想法，不会轻易动摇。　　回到日本后，忍意外的收到了一封来信，写信的是名叫爱丽丝（田中真奈美 配音）英国少女，她是忍在英国寄宿家庭房东的女儿。爱丽丝告诉忍，这一次，她决定前往日本，来忍家寄宿。追随爱丽丝而来的，是她的青梅竹马九条可怜（东山奈央 配音），拥有典型外国人样貌的她实际上是混血儿。围绕着三位活泼可爱的少女，充满了快乐和温馨的校园喜剧正式拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h444U03Gt41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9TBCWmF3Vq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0sR8n0MsTE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/594rQ9c9b21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1eS68fkGPB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RcbP6KNg2y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dqEv96wMJF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Yf5j4gAJdc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H3ma7dScEa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CnRBZJy3zc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9pKeKJqZWA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4UgpDebMfH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:33.179Z"}